<% content_for :title, "Omarchy on Apple Silicon" %>
<h1>omarchy-m-testing</h1>
<p>Test every hardware feature of your Apple Silicon Mac under Omarchy, and share the results.</p>
<h2>Install</h2>
<pre id="install"><code>curl -fsSL <%= install_url %> | bash</code></pre>
<p>The installer downloads the latest release of <code>omarchy-m-test</code>, verifies its signature and installs it for your user. Then run <code>omarchy-m-test</code>.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/maralcbr/omarchy-m-testing">Source, releases and the release signing key</a></p>
